# Remotion videos

When the user asks for a Remotion video, motion graphics, launch promo, kinetic type, or UI animation:

1. Read and follow `.cursor/skills/remotion-motion-studio/SKILL.md`
2. Read and follow `.cursor/skills/realistic-remotion-components/SKILL.md`
3. Use the strongest available model for the creative pass (not cheap/fast)
4. Search MagicPath / ready components before inventing UI
5. Remotion-only timing (`useCurrentFrame`, `spring`, `interpolate`, `Sequence`)
6. Anti-AI look bans + critique loop to scores ≥ 8 before final render

Also load MagicPath skills: `remotion-motion-studio` and `realistic-remotion-components`.
